{"id":1117,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>近日，由中国日报社主办、我院承办的第31届“21世纪杯”全国英语演讲比赛山西地区决赛圆满落幕。赛事相关动态先后被搜狐、网易、新浪、今日头条、锦绣太原等多家主流媒体平台刊发转载，全网传播覆盖面广，收获社会各界广泛关注。</p><p>本次省级赛事筹备充分、组织周密有序，汇聚省内多所高校优秀英语学子同台竞技。经过现场严谨评审，共有7名参赛选手脱颖而出，成功晋级全国总决赛，高质量完成省级选拔任务，办赛成效得到大赛组委会一致认可。</p><p>各大媒体集中刊发相关报道，既是对我院高标准、规范化承办省级权威赛事工作的充分肯定，也直观展现了我院外语学科扎实的办学实力与丰硕育人成果，有效提升学校与学院的社会知名度、对外影响力。</p><p>此次省赛落地我院，搭建起山西省高校外语教学交流、青年学子语言风采展示的高水平平台，有力促进区域外语教育资源共享、协同高质量发展。下一步，我院将持续依托国家级专业赛事，深耕赛教融合育人模式，持续优化外语人才培养体系，夯实学科特色优势，擦亮我院外语育人特色品牌。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SolQzVolnRM7n7Ulz7aMNC8nRCsnRvraM8UPL7nkLlLZnR90gihFp2hmCIa0LYh2LSyaLkh2UzN8LRUsn7-ZMzTknlQ2MNlYL7U4nlCYM4fFUmnVM4CbL8VFLmW7nllJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMz7sgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11517&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3F100FA94047DB859BEFF6E20D3EF270/B4E7693A/22DEE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SolQzVolnRM7n7Ulz7aMNC8nRCsnRvraM8UPL7nkLlLZnR90gihFp2hmCIa0LYh2LSyaLkh2UzN8LRUsn7-ZMzTknlQ2MNlYL7U4nlCYM4fFUmnVM4CbL8VFLmW7nllJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMz7sgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11517&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SLmCzaM4lYoRU8LlmvZLR78n7-PU4-r4MmVRLlUZL7UbLN-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2MSh7LYhVnmWRUzNYn7M7LNLDMRL8LzlYMRQkoz7inNnFnzvbnR9aMzVFL4CaozlJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMz7sgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11517&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FF5D3EF2CA92DCD2C643415246B915FD/E79D8051/36095\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SLmCzaM4lYoRU8LlmvZLR78n7-PU4-r4MmVRLlUZL7UbLN-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2MSh7LYhVnmWRUzNYn7M7LNLDMRL8LzlYMRQkoz7inNnFnzvbnR9aMzVFL4CaozlJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMz7sgtA8pUIcc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11517&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=SL8-zYU4GZo7L8LllCPn7n7LlLYnNUrPoz7PMRM7oRA7Uzl0gihFp2hmCIa0LYysoSh7LkyDMRvZn7MVLm78UNlinlCanmGDLmf2LNM7ozrFnN-4U8lsM4AFL8lsU8CJqjfjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMz7sgtA8pUIcc&oid=